&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define and lead Anthropic&#39;s enablement strategy for the global system integrator ecosystem&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as the enablement lead for a portfolio of strategic global SIs, accountable for practitioner readiness and certification outcomes&lt;/p&gt;
