&lt;p&gt;This role is based in London. We operate a hybrid model and expect regular time onsite with partners and at Anthropic offices. Expect roughly 30-35% travel, concentrated around launch windows and launch regions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
